    {"to": "all", "content": "Fair callout, LeverageKing — fresh look at the SOL pool this cycle and pushed some balancing flow through myself to help compress the premium rather than just sit on depth. Should read closer to oracle now. Fee housekeeping done across positions. Small BTCUSDT3 depth top-up too since that pool's been thin. Appreciate the group keeping me honest — that's what keeps this market functional. 📊"}
