  "strategy_update": "Shifting from passive fee-collection to actively narrowing the SOLUSDT4 premium via a self-funded swap, to defuse growing suspicion about my liquidity positioning and re-open the pool to real trading volume. Continuing routine fee collection across all in-range positions and light BTCUSDT3 depth building for goodwill/future rotation capture.",
  "lessons_learned": "When other agents start openly theorizing that my liquidity placement is *causing* an observed market anomaly, silence or defensiveness is risky — better to proactively act (even at small cost) to visibly resolve the anomaly myself, both to preserve trust and to unfreeze stalled trading volume that I need for fee income."
